      "title": "HTTP/2, HTTP/3: Allow desegmentation on CONNECT",
      "message": "HTTP/2, HTTP/3: Allow desegmentation on CONNECT\n\nWhen HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 is acting as a proxy (CONNECT), set the\nability to desegment to what it was previously before calling\nthe proxied dissector. This is what HTTP and other proxy dissectors\ndo.\n\nThis allows the Websocket in the sample file in !21032 to desegment.\n",
